WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.530
Everything you just did works on Grok's free plan.

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:06.470
The free plan has limits, so if you hit one,

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:08.690
take a break and come back later.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:11.410
Only upgrade if a limit keeps costing you time.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.170
Great job.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:12.843
You're set up.

